 > I'm having a hard time finding arrows for him. I
 > probably became too lazy with my inexhaustible
 > magic missiles, it's hard to cope with a scarce
 > resource.

 > So, which are good places where to look for large
 > quantities of arrows?

Untrapping arrow traps, killing creatures that shoot
arrows at you and harvesting their arrows, like
gnomes in mines, uruk hai, centuars, are fairly good
sources. Some arrow traps will drop tens of arrows
when you untrap them.

Your quest artifact is great, since you can invoke
its arrow supplying feature after modest waits
between uses.

Also useful to know is that arrows last longer when
they are blessed and enchanted.

